            <ArticleTitle>[Prevalence of bronchial asthma in poor environmental areas].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>28-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Among patients with bronchial asthma, there are predominantly females who live in an industrial area. In this area, patients with severe bronchial asthma are 2.4 times more and those with a severe exacerbation are twice more. Bronchial asthma may serve as a marker of the poor environment.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
